    mc "(O que eu não daria para tomar um banho que durasse mais do que alguns minutos.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:14
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_6bb2f1de:

#   mc "(But those are the rules, \"conserve the water\".)"
    mc "(Mas essas são as regras: \"economize água\".)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:15
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_74eb86ff:

#   mc "(Hmm... What's going on in there?)"
    mc "(Hum... O que está acontecendo lá dentro?)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:19
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_688af963:

#   vic "I think I’ve made a grave error in judgment."
    vic "Acho que cometi um grave erro de julgamento."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:22
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_9b5ba4ea:

#   v "What do you mean?"
    v "O que você quer dizer?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:24
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_0e0484cb:

#   vic "[y_name] wasn't ready to lead a mission."
    vic "[y_name] Não estava preparado para liderar uma missão."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:26
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_227ee5b5:

#   vic "That much is obvious."
    vic "Isso é óbvio."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:28
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_5a45ff70:

#   vic "And I'm starting to believe that he never will be."
    vic "E estou começando a acreditar que ele nunca será."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:30
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_46e27f1b:

#   vic "He has the wrong attitude."
    vic "Ele tem a atitude errada."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:33
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_76c39b2e:

#   v "You're too harsh on him, [vic_name]."
    v "Você está sendo muito duro com ele. [vic_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:34
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_22635a1a:

#   v "Clearly, he didn't make those mistakes on purpose."
    v "Claramente, ele não cometeu esses erros de propósito."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:36
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_047df7f5:

#   vic "You know what your problem is, [v_name]?"
    vic "Você sabe qual é o seu problema, [v_name]?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:38
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_0634ceed:

#   vic "You're too soft. On all three of them."
    vic "Você é muito fraco. Com os três."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:39
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_97dc3a6d:

#   vic "And you make me look weak."
    vic "E você me faz parecer fraco."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:41
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_800b77aa:

#   v "That was never my intention."
    v "Essa nunca foi minha intenção."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:43
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_6f395582:

#   vic "I'm trying to set us all up for that big payday and you constantly undermine my authority."
    vic "Estou tentando garantir que todos nós tenhamos um grande retorno financeiro, e você constantemente mina minha autoridade."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:45
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_7a6d1872:

#   vic "You need to be a lot stricter. Otherwise, they're never going to learn and we're never going to get anywhere."
    vic "Você precisa ser muito mais rigoroso. Caso contrário, eles nunca vão aprender e nunca vamos chegar a lugar nenhum."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:47
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_d0a841e3:

#   vic "And these kinds of errors like the ones [y_name] caused today, along with you over-coddling him, is what will eventually see all of us in the slammer."
    vic "E esse tipo de erro, como aqueles [y_name] O que aconteceu hoje, junto com a sua superproteção a ele, é o que eventualmente nos levará a todos para a cadeia."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:49
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_45c17298:

#   vic "I honestly don't get you sometimes."
    vic "Sinceramente, às vezes não te entendo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:51
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_a767f042:

#   vic "You all don't respect me enough or appreciate what I've done for this [private_group]."
    vic "Vocês não me respeitam o suficiente nem apreciam o que eu fiz por isso. [private_group]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:54
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_894c0f4d:

#   v "I'll try harder, [vic_name]. And I'll make sure that the three of them do likewise."
    v "Vou me esforçar mais, [vic_name] E eu vou garantir que os três façam o mesmo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:57
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_11426c4a:

#   v "Where are you going?"
    v "Onde você está indo?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:59
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_3f87172a:

#   vic "Downstairs to get some more scotch. And to watch some TV."
    vic "Desci para pegar mais uísque. E para assistir um pouco de TV."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:61
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_447831c1:

#   vic "I'm too agitated to sleep. Not that you can do anything to help me with that."
    vic "Estou muito agitado para dormir. Não que você possa fazer algo para me ajudar com isso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:66
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_6d90f7a1:

#   mc "(He didn't see me, luckily.)"
    mc "(Por sorte, ele não me viu.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:69
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_aa61f295:

#   mc "(Poor [mc_v_address]. She doesn't deserve that kind of treatment.)"
    mc "(Pobre [mc_v_address] Ela não merece esse tipo de tratamento."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:71
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_9ce3846d:

#   mc "(She deserves a hell of a lot better than him.)"
    mc "Ela merece muito mais do que ele."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:73
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_b2be773b:

#   mc "(She's one of the most caring people that you're ever likely to meet.)"
    mc "(Ela é uma das pessoas mais carinhosas que você provavelmente conhecerá.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:76
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_e8713ec2:

#   mc "(Hmm... Looks like the catch on that door is still broken.)"
    mc "(Hum... Parece que a trava daquela porta ainda está quebrada.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:78
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_ff927a3d:

#   mc "(I don't get why [mc_vic_address] treats her like this, or acts like she's invisible.)"
    mc "(Não entendo por quê) [mc_vic_address] a trata assim, ou age como se ela fosse invisível.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:80
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_4dc7df88:

#   mc "(I mean, she's still pretty stunning for a woman her age.)"
    mc "(Quer dizer, ela ainda é muito bonita para uma mulher da idade dela.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:81
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_1ac1df23:

#   mc "(A goddess, some might say.)"
    mc "(Uma deusa, alguns diriam.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:82
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_edbf087e:

#   mc "(If only she believed it.)"
    mc "(Se ao menos ela acreditasse nisso.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:84
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_a72c2b24:

#   mc "(I guess it doesn't help that she's with someone who isn't in any way supportive of her wants and needs, especially emotionally.)"
    mc "(Imagino que não ajude o fato de ela estar com alguém que não apoia em nada seus desejos e necessidades, especialmente emocionais.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:86
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_74c7a023:

#   mc "(I can't help but feel responsible that [mc_vic_address] took his anger and frustrations out on her.)"
    mc "Não consigo evitar me sentir responsável por isso. [mc_vic_address] Ele descontou sua raiva e frustrações nela."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:88
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_2a1e8aff:

#   mc "(And this isn't the first time he's done it.)"
    mc "(E esta não é a primeira vez que ele faz isso.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:90
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_b5803ac6:

#   mc "(Life would be so much easier if he wasn't around.)"
    mc "(A vida seria muito mais fácil se ele não estivesse por perto.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:93
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_03cfdf03:

#   mc "(But it's not like he's just going to suddenly \"up and leave\".)"
    mc "(Mas não é como se ele fosse simplesmente \"de repente ir embora\".)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:103
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_e5dade59:

#   "{i}To breaking news now...{/i}"
    "{i}Às últimas notícias...{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:105
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_6e3f543b:

#   "{i}A man was discovered locked in an abandoned basement and was rescued by police after an anonymous tip.{/i}"
    "{i}Um homem foi encontrado trancado em um porão abandonado e resgatado pela polícia após uma denúncia anônima.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:106
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_5777a6b7:

#   "{i}But in a bizarre turn of events, shortly after being treated by ambulance staff, the man escaped from police custody.{/i}"
    "{i}Mas, em uma reviravolta bizarra, pouco depois de ser atendido pela equipe de ambulância, o homem fugiu da custódia policial.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:107
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_d72ca553:

#   "{i}We've been informed that he stole a car from a little old lady and he's likely to have fled the city.{/i}"
    "{i}Fomos informados de que ele roubou o carro de uma senhora idosa e provavelmente fugiu da cidade.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:109
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_fbe479c4:

#   "{i}So far they have no leads to his exact whereabouts, but they believe that he has no fixed abode.{/i}"
    "{i}Até o momento, não há pistas sobre seu paradeiro exato, mas acreditam que ele não tenha residência fixa.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:111
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_37937fcc:

#   "{i}He is a white Caucasion male in his mid to late 20s, around six feet tall, was last seen wearing a plain, grey t-shirt and is considered to be a person of interest.{/i}"
    "{i}Trata-se de um homem caucasiano branco, com idade entre 25 e 30 anos, aproximadamente 1,80 m de altura, visto pela última vez vestindo uma camiseta cinza lisa e considerado pessoa de interesse.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:113
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_dd0f4168:

#   "{i}Please call crime stoppers if you have any information.{/i}"
    "{i}Por favor, ligue para o serviço de denúncias anônimas se tiver alguma informação.{/i}"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:115
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_b04f3e0e:

#   vic "It sounds like this little asshole is just asking for trouble."
    vic "Parece que esse moleque está pedindo para se meter em encrenca."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:116
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_55d131ac:

#   vic "I wonder if {i}Kings County Nine-Nine{/i} is on?"
    vic "Será que...? {i} Condado de Kings Nine-Nine{/i} Está ligado?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:118
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_7f693930:

#   mc "(Well he won't be going to bed any time soon.)"
    mc "(Bem, ele não vai para a cama tão cedo.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:120
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_d237e96c:

#   mc "(If I'm going to have a discussion with the girls about this new mission, I better do it now.)"
    mc "(Se eu vou ter uma conversa com as meninas sobre essa nova missão, é melhor fazer isso agora.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:121
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_8ed00ce4:

#   mc "([a_name] would surely know something, given that she put that encrypted code on the drive.)"
    mc "([a_name] certamente saberia de algo, visto que foi ela quem colocou aquele código criptografado no pen drive."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:122
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_25095792:

#   mc "(I'll find out what she knows...)"
    mc "(Vou descobrir o que ela sabe...)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:135
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_01_f198d9ff:

#   mc "(Who should I talk to first?)"
    mc "(Com quem devo falar primeiro?)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 1/03_01_The_Girls_Rooms.rpy:139
translate brazil lb_ep01_girls_rooms_01_f6eeec92:

#   mc "(There's not much else I can do so it's time for me to call it a night...)"
    mc "(Não há muito mais que eu possa fazer, então é hora de eu encerrar por hoje...)"

